    "en-gdpr-dpo": {
      "answer": "A controller must designate a data protection officer if the processing is carried out by a public authority or body, or if their core activities involve processing operations requiring regular and systematic monitoring of data subjects on a large scale, or processing of special categories of data on a large scale.",
